# Extra font binaries are fetched by scripts/fetch_fonts.py and not committed.
# DejaVu Sans ships with the app so inserted text extracts correctly on every
# OS (system Arial maps space/NBSP and hyphen/soft-hyphen to one glyph, which
# corrupts copy/search of stamped text).
*
!.gitignore
!DejaVuSans.ttf
!DejaVuSans-Bold.ttf
!DejaVu-LICENSE.txt
